      performanceNotes: '<250MB memory, 60 FPS. Three sphere vertices with line edges. Collapse particles use shared instanced geometry.',
      tripoPrompt: 'A glowing triangle in dark space with amethyst, cyan, and emerald vertices connected by pulsing energy lines, one vertex dissolving causing collapse, 8K.',
